From: Thomas Bourgoin <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 2 Jul 2024 13:53:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 0996/1695] clk: stm32mp21: add clock calibration for HSI / MSI
 clocks

HSI monitoring control, with LSE, is based on the RCC HSI Frequency
Monitoring Control Register (RCC_HSIFMONCR) and RCC HSI Frequency
Value Register (RCC_HSIFVALR).
MSI monitor is based on the clock frequency calculator.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 50c4893c2e90b8f081a24b101f643c5fc2f1d66a clk: stm32mp21: add clock calibration for HSI / MSI clocks]
