Signed-off-by: Thomas Bourgoin <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/390830
Reviewed-by: Gabriel FERNANDEZ <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
